id=gms_millet_guard
name=Millet Guard
version=2.0.8
versionCode=208
author=E3N
summary=Configurable HyperOS Millet/Greeze no-restrict guard
description=Keeps user-selected apps in MILLET_NO_RESTRICT_APP while preserving unrelated entries. Includes DNS-aware FCM recovery, lost-reconnect-alarm self-healing, xtables-lock-safe firewall checks, and opt-in HyperOS SwipeUpClean FCM eligibility restoration.
